    "resource_info": "<h2>Imlaei Quran Script</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4\">The Imlaei script is a modern Arabic writing style commonly used for implementing search due to its simplified and phonetic structure. Below is a comparison of two sample Ayahs in Imlaei and Uthmani scripts.</p>\n<h2>Imlaei Vs Uthmani</h2>\n<div class=\"table-responsive\">\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-striped\">\n<thead class=\"table-light\">\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Ayah</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Imlaei Script</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Uthmani Script</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-center\">Surah Al-Fatihah (1:4)</td>\n<td class=\"text-end qpc-hafs\">مالكِ يومِ الدِّينِ</td>\n<td class=\"text-end qpc-hafs\">مَّلِكِ يومِ الدِّينِ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-center\">Surah Al-Baqarah (2:2)</td>\n<td class=\"text-end qpc-hafs\">ذَلِكَ الكِتَابُ لا رَيْبَ فِيهِ</td>\n<td class=\"text-end qpc-hafs\">ذَّالِكَ الكِتَّابُ لا رَيْبَ فِيهِ</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>",
    "resource_id": "",
